<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>ASH RECOIL </Major>
    <Description>Works for most ARs and Rifles with Magnified Optics! pt.2

Tested on: Ash, Jackle, buck

SETUP

Bind macro to left mouse key. Make sure the operation mode is set to the second option. (HOLD UNTIL RELEASED

)

FYI

Macro will not work if Keyran Drivers are not installed/activated!



GAME SETTINGS

Resolution-1920x1080

FOV-84

SenseHorizontal-13

SenseVertical-13

DPI-800

Created by HOODIExSZN
Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>1</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 4
Delay 5 ms
MoveR -1 4
Delay 5 ms
MoveR 1 4
Delay 5 ms
MoveR -1 4
Delay 5 ms
LeftUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>